flowchart LR
  subgraph Phone[User iPhone]
    Even[Official Even app]
    Client[Alfred WebView / SDK]
    Companion[Paired web companion]
    NotifyApp[HA iPhone Companion app]
    Even --- Client
  end
  G2[G2 display / microphone] <-->|BLE through Even host| Even
  R1[Optional R1 input] -->|BLE through Even host| Even
  subgraph Host[User host: reference Mac M2 / UTM / HAOS]
    Gateway[Tailscale Serve: TLS terminates on user Mac]
    HA[Alfred integration in HA Core]
    Rules[Rules / bounded tools / current approved targets]
    Store[Private HA Store / durable reminders]
    Admin[HA-authenticated command centre]
    HA --> Rules
    HA --- Store
    Admin --> HA
  end
  Client <-->|Private HTTPS / scoped client token| Gateway
  Companion <-->|HTTPS / own paired credential| Gateway
  Gateway <-->|Private TCP forwarding / HTTP to HA VM| HA
  Rules --> Native[Maintained HA integrations / devices / to-do lists]
  HA --> Speech[Selected local or cloud STT]
  Rules --> AI[Optional local interpreter / cloud or local conversation]
  Rules --> Personal[Optional OAuth mail / calendar / search / feeds / weather]
  Store --> Target[Selected HA mobile_app notify service]
  Target --> Push[External remote push infrastructure]
  Push --> NotifyApp
  Transport[Tailscale: direct preferred / encrypted relay fallback] -.-> Client
  Transport -.-> Gateway
